            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2 id="welcome-to-mycology-online">Welcome to Mycology Online</h2>

<p class="u-lead-text">Since 1998, Mycology Online has been providing&nbsp;information on the identification and management of human and animal fungal infections.&nbsp;The site provides a range of educational materials including a mould identification self assessment module, descriptions of fungal pathogens and diseases, antifungal susceptibility data, synoptic identification keys for moulds and links to societies and to other mycology sites.</p></div>
      
